    "detailed_description": "A cute, arcade-like golf game set in a cartoon world. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/9214efc6065080e9e491b97bdd49ce58.poster.avif?t=1734524869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/9214efc6065080e9e491b97bdd49ce58.webm?t=1734524869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/9214efc6065080e9e491b97bdd49ce58.mp4?t=1734524869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Goals &amp; Challenges</strong></h2>Each level comes with a set of goals and challenges. Beat the goals to proceed to the next level. Beat all the challenges to unlock new skills and accessories. Beat the timer to earn a medal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Character Customization</strong></h2>Get your glow up with a fresh coat of paint and some cute headwear!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/6ed2455f01dfac4070015f67a919356c.poster.avif?t=1734524869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/6ed2455f01dfac4070015f67a919356c.webm?t=1734524869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/6ed2455f01dfac4070015f67a919356c.mp4?t=1734524869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Achievements?</strong></h2>Have you really beaten the game if you haven't unlocked all the achievements?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>See You On The Leaderboards!</strong></h2>Will your creativity and speed earn you that sweet spot in the top of the leaderboards? Only time will tell!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Relaxing, Zen Experience</strong></h2>Grab all the collectibles, earn all of the accessories, and beat all of the goals and challenges. Or take your time and enjoy the beautiful world. There's no rush!",
    "about_the_game": "A cute, arcade-like golf game set in a cartoon world. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/9214efc6065080e9e491b97bdd49ce58.poster.avif?t=1734524869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/9214efc6065080e9e491b97bdd49ce58.webm?t=1734524869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/9214efc6065080e9e491b97bdd49ce58.mp4?t=1734524869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Goals &amp; Challenges</strong></h2>Each level comes with a set of goals and challenges. Beat the goals to proceed to the next level. Beat all the challenges to unlock new skills and accessories. Beat the timer to earn a medal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Character Customization</strong></h2>Get your glow up with a fresh coat of paint and some cute headwear!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/6ed2455f01dfac4070015f67a919356c.poster.avif?t=1734524869\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/6ed2455f01dfac4070015f67a919356c.webm?t=1734524869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1666470/extras/6ed2455f01dfac4070015f67a919356c.mp4?t=1734524869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Achievements?</strong></h2>Have you really beaten the game if you haven't unlocked all the achievements?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>See You On The Leaderboards!</strong></h2>Will your creativity and speed earn you that sweet spot in the top of the leaderboards? Only time will tell!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Relaxing, Zen Experience</strong></h2>Grab all the collectibles, earn all of the accessories, and beat all of the goals and challenges. Or take your time and enjoy the beautiful world. There's no rush!",
